{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18003","headline":"感春四首 四 · 韩愈","name":"感春四首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我恨不如江头人，长网横江遮紫鳞。\n独宿荒陂射凫雁，卖纳租赋官不嗔。\n归来欢笑对妻子，衣食自给宁羞贫。\n今者无端读书史，智慧祗足劳精神。\n画蛇着足无处用，两鬓霜白趋埃尘。\n乾愁漫解坐自累，与衆异趣谁相亲。\n数桮浇肠虽暂醉，皎皎万虑醒还新。\n百年未满不得死，且可勤买抛青春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18003.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18003","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}